&lt;li&gt;Lead technical assessments and migrations of existing applications and data workloads to SingleStore, while onboarding new teams, applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable self-service onboarding capabilities, including APIs, configuration templates, automated provisioning, access requests, pipeline deployment and operational guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize cloud database spend through workload right-sizing, consolidation, scheduling and performance tuning; develop transparent SingleStore cluster, application and team-level cost allocation and showback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production readiness and database reliability: monitoring, incident triage, root-cause analysis, recoverability, deployment controls and collaboration with SingleStore Helios support.&lt;/li&gt;
